                Sago Mini World is one of the most beloved first apps for toddlers and preschoolers. If your child
                adores Sago Mini's warm, rule-free play and you want to discover more open-ended apps, including
                real-world nature exploration and one-time purchase options, these 6 thoughtful picks are a wonderful
