                </p>
                <p>
                  <strong>Why Sago Mini fans love it:</strong> Children who love Sago Mini's friendly animal characters
                  warm up immediately to Elinor the bunny and Daniel Tiger. Parents can also pre-download favorite games
                  inside the app over Wi-Fi so they work offline on road trips.
                </p>
              </div>

