                </p>
                <p>
                  <strong>Why Sago Mini fans love it:</strong> Fiete shares Sago Mini's warm, visual slapstick humor and
                  intuitive drag-and-drop interactions, letting preschoolers harvest vegetables, bake bread, and care for
                  farm animals at a peaceful rhythm.
                </p>
              </div>

